Subject: Scope the stockout cooldown by GKE version

Why: Upstream calls the stockout cooldown global, but from GKE 1.36.3-gke.1244000 it is zonal; without the version split this skill contradicts gke-compute-classes, which states the change.
Local-Issue: #2692
Upstream-Issue: none filed yet
Retire-When: upstream gke-cluster-autoscaler gives the cooldown scope by GKE version

